[node name="CrawlText" type="Label3D" parent="CrawlLayer/SubViewport" unique_id=592285922]
unique_name_in_owner = true
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 0.469472, 0.882948, 0, -0.882948, 0.469472, 0, -1.8, 0.8)
modulate = Color(0.97, 0.79, 0.31, 1)
outline_modulate = Color(0, 0, 0, 0.9)
text = "OUTER REACH // CYCLE 4097

The last human convoy enters an uncharted asteroid storm. The asteroid field, regrettably, has declined to queue.

Its pilot cannot see far enough to navigate alone. Mission Control has described the situation as less than ideal, which is rarely encouraging.

Two navigation intelligences awaken: ALPHA and BETA. Each offers a path through the dark. One protects the ship. One accepts the risk. Both insist they are helping. Neither has provided references.

Their loyalties will change. Their voices will not.

Read the routes. Choose who to trust. Take control when trust is not enough.



Do try to keep the ship in one piece. The paperwork is formidable."
outline_size = 8
vertical_alignment = 0
line_spacing = 14.0
autowrap_mode = 2
autowrap_trim_flags = 64
width = 600.0

